{
 "id": "federal-ja",
 "title": "Federal J&A documents",
 "blurb": "Justifications for contracts awarded without full and open competition, posted on SAM.gov since 2025-01-20.",
 "hfDataset": "abigailhaddad/federal-ja-documents",
 "source": {
  "format": "parquet",
  "urls": [
   "https://huggingface.co/datasets/abigailhaddad/federal-ja-documents/resolve/main/data/notices.parquet"
  ]
 },
 "key": "notice_id",
 "asOf": {
  "sql": "SELECT CAST(max(posted_date) AS VARCHAR) FROM t",
  "label": "Latest notice in this table was posted {value} (UTC)."
 },
 "covers": "One row per SAM.gov Contract Opportunities notice that is a Justification and Approval (or a similar justification for other than full and open competition). The original files and their extracted text are in the dataset's other tables on Hugging Face; this page shows the notice table.",
 "caveats": [
  "About half the rows are Special Notices picked because their title suggests a justification, not notices SAM typed as Justification. The \"Why it is here\" column says which.",
  "Award amounts and the competition fields come from SAM's award block or a match to USAspending where one was found. Many rows have no match, and a blank is not \"none\".",
  "Some attachments could not be saved (not public, deleted, or only a link), so the files folder for a notice can be empty or missing.",
  "The AI-generated extraction and theme tables in the dataset are experimental and are not shown here."
 ],
 "links": [
  {
   "label": "Dataset card",
   "href": "https://huggingface.co/datasets/abigailhaddad/federal-ja-documents"
  },
  {
   "label": "Code",
   "href": "https://github.com/abigailhaddad/federal-ja-documents"
  }
 ],
 "searchColumns": [
  "title",
  "agency",
  "office",
  "awardee",
  "solicitation_number",
  "award_number",
  "description"
 ],
 "defaultSort": {
  "col": "posted_date",
  "dir": "desc"
 },
 "pageSize": 50,
 "detail": {
  "title": "{title}",
  "links": [
   {
    "label": "Notice on SAM.gov",
    "href": "{sam_link}"
   },
   {
    "label": "Saved files on Hugging Face",
    "href": "https://huggingface.co/datasets/abigailhaddad/federal-ja-documents/tree/main/files/{notice_id:enc}"
   },
   {
    "label": "Award on USAspending",
    "href": "{usaspending_permalink}"
   }
  ]
 },
